    "summary": "A usage card for an agent session. The top row reads used / capacity with a percent, over a thin bar split into one coloured segment per token bucket. Opening the row grows the card to list each bucket with its tokens and share, free space, deferred buckets that do not count, and collapsible member lists. Below it, each plan limit shows its reset time, percent used and a progress bar, and the plan heading links to plan settings.",
