    "reducedMotion": "Under reduced motion the reply appears at once instead of streaming, the composer glow stops pulsing, the thinking label drops its shimmer, and hover and panel-width transitions use motion-reduce:transition-none. The step checklist still advances so the run stays readable.",
    "cleanup": "The run timeout is cleared on every run change and on unmount. The dictation timer, the share copied-state timer and the browser loading timer each clear on unmount.",
    "acceptance": "At 1280 × 800 a sidebar, a chat and a changes panel fill the frame. The coding scenario chat ticks through five steps, then a reply streams in and a fourth file appears under Uncommitted changes. Typing a message and pressing Enter adds a bubble and starts a new run; Stop ends it. Selecting another chat, Automations or Customize switches the middle pane. The sidebar collapses to a rail, the panel hides, widens and switches to Browser.",
