    "acceptance": "At 1280 × 800 a sidebar, a grey thread pane and a gallery fill the frame. The \"image generation\" thread shows a user prompt and a loader that counts to 100% and then becomes a finished card while the picture appears first in the gallery with an \"Image ready\" toast. Typing a prompt and pressing Enter adds a bubble and a new loader. Picking a style chip, a model, Draft mode or a new aspect changes the next image. Selecting another thread, Automations or Customize switches the middle pane. The sidebar and gallery hide and come back. Below 1024px both become drawers.",
