    "reducedMotion": "The card itself has no motion beyond its controls' own hover and focus styles. `AuthMediaCarousel` checks `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` when its effect runs and, if set, never schedules a beat, so it holds on the first slide at full bleed. It also does nothing with fewer than two slides.",
    "cleanup": "The carousel keeps exactly one pending `setTimeout`, cleared whenever the phase, slide count or interval changes and on unmount. The card adds no timers or listeners.",
    "acceptance": "In `signin` the card shows the title, email and password fields, \"Remember me\" (checked) and \"Forgot password?\", a full-width \"Sign in\" button, the divider and the providers, and a \"New here? Create an account\" footer. `inline` shows icon-only squares that wrap; `grid` stretches them across one row; `stacked` labels each one. Submitting calls `onSubmit` with the form's FormData. `verify` shows OTP boxes in two groups of three, no providers and a \"Send a new one\" button. With `media`, the card splits in two at `md` and above and shows only the form below it. The carousel rests on an image for about 3.2s, shrinks it into a rounded card, swings it left into depth while the next card comes in from the right, then grows the new one back to full bleed.",
