    "reducedMotion": "Under prefers-reduced-motion the SVG animate and animateTransform elements are not rendered at all, so the avatar shows its resting outline with open eyes; shape, colour and face are unchanged.",
    "cleanup": "No timers, listeners or rAF: the morph and blink are SMIL animations owned by the SVG and stop when the element unmounts.",
