    "reducedMotion": "Nothing moves. The only animation is a 150ms colour transition on hover, which is not motion and is left as is.",
    "cleanup": "Nothing to clean up. The component is stateless markup with no listeners, timers or effects.",
    "acceptance": "Three items render on one line with a chevron between each pair and none before the first. Hovering an ancestor darkens its text and shows a rounded tinted background without moving any text. The last item is darker, has `aria-current=\"page\"` and does not react to hover or clicks. Tab reaches only the ancestor items, each showing a focus ring. In an RTL container the chevrons point left. A trail wider than its container scrolls sideways with no visible scrollbar.",
    "criticalRegion": "critical",
