    "reducedMotion": "Hover tints on slots, stepper buttons and agenda rows carry `motion-reduce:transition-none`. The popover, modal and segmented control use the kit's own reduced-motion handling; nothing else animates.",
    "cleanup": "No timers, observers or global listeners. The time grid sets its scroll position once in an effect, and the popover anchor is a ref. Overlays and the Toaster clean up their own listeners.",
    "acceptance": "At 1280x800 the sidebar shows Calendar selected, the title reads \"August 2026\", the month grid starts on Sun 26 Jul and 20 Aug is ringed as today with Stand-up, Team lunch and \"+2 more\". Pressing Stand-up opens a popover with four guests, the meeting code and Join meeting. \"+2 more\" opens the Day view for Thursday, 20 Aug 2026 with a now line at 10:40. In Week view, Roadmap review and Vendor call on 18 Aug sit side by side. Next week reads \"23 – 29 Aug 2026\". New event with a title adds it and toasts. Accepting \"Design system sync\" in the inbox adds it on 21 Aug. Delete removes an event and Undo restores it. Clicking Finance in the sidebar shows the placeholder and \"Back to Calendar\" returns.",
