    "cleanup": "The component adds no timers or listeners. The kit SegmentedControl and Pagination disconnect their ResizeObservers on unmount.",
    "acceptance": "The demo card reads \"16 campaigns\", newest edit first with \"Founder story video · US\" on top. Sorting CTR descending puts \"Brand search · US\" (7.50%) first and ascending puts \"Creator collab · EU\" (0.80%) first, with the three drafts showing \"–\" at the bottom both ways. \"Newsletter promo · EU\" shows 108% in rose with a full pink bar. Choosing \"Draft\" leaves 3 rows; choosing the Meta channel leaves 4 and hides the pager. At 360px the table scrolls inside the card. Light and dark both read correctly.",
