    "summary": "A grey card with the kit Tabs on top and an uppercase metric caption on the right. Each tab holds a ranked list where every row sits on a light blue bar sized against the leader, with an optional icon, the label and the row's share of the tab total. Five rows show by default; the last one fades and a chevron button reveals the rest.",
