    "cleanup": "The component adds no timers or listeners. The kit TabList disconnects its underline ResizeObserver on unmount.",
    "acceptance": "The demo opens on Channels with Google Ads 39%, Meta 25%, X Ads 14%, LinkedIn 8% and a faded Email 7%, each bar sized against Google Ads. Clicking the chevron shows TikTok 4% and Referral 3% and sets aria-expanded. Choosing Campaigns ranks \"Free trial push · US\" first with five rows and a \"Show 1 more\" button. At 360px the three tabs fit and the Sessions caption moves above the list. Light and dark both read correctly.",
