    "reducedMotion": "Only 150ms scale on thumbs, swatches and the well plus opacity on the selection ring and the kit popover's entrance. The component does not branch on `prefers-reduced-motion`; the movements are a few pixels and colour updates are instant either way.",
    "cleanup": "React Aria releases its drag listeners when a drag ends or the control unmounts; the popover's overlay and focus management are torn down on close. No timers.",
    "acceptance": "The inline picker shows a saturation field with a white thumb, a full-spectrum hue rail and a hex field reading the current colour. Dragging in the field updates the swatch and hex live; dragging the hue rail through any position keeps the saturation and brightness. Typing \"#22C55E\" in the hex field and pressing Enter applies it without leaving the field. Clicking a preset selects it with a white inner ring. A ColorWell opens the same editor in a popover from its round swatch; with `showAlpha`, the opacity rail sits on a checkerboard.",
