    "cleanup": "`useResizeObserver` disconnects its observer on unmount. Everything else is CSS and React event props, so nothing else needs tearing down.",
    "acceptance": "The default card reads \"Contributions this year\", \"529\" and a lime \"+12.6%\" chip, four stat tiles (191 active days, best day 10 on Jun 26, a 14-day streak, 1.4 a day), an \"Activity\" row with Weekly, Monthly and Yearly tabs, and a violet 7-row calendar with Jan–Dec labels and a Less → More legend. Hovering a cell rings it and shows a count and a date such as \"Wed, Jan 1, 2025\". Monthly shows 5 × 12 week cells and Yearly shows three year rows. Picking another swatch in the demo recolours the grid and the legend.",
    "criticalRegion": "critical",
