    "reducedMotion": "The icon cross-fade, the chevron rotation and the hover colours all carry `motion-reduce:transition-none`. The kit Dropdown panel skips its fade, scale and blur. Under reduced motion the state still changes, only without animation.",
    "cleanup": "The copied-state timeout belongs to `useCopyToClipboard` and is cleared on unmount and before each new copy. The Blob URL fallback revokes its object URL after 60 seconds. Outside-press listeners belong to the kit Dropdown and go away when it closes.",
    "acceptance": "Clicking \"Copy Page\" puts the exact Markdown on the clipboard, and the button reads \"Copied\" with a lime check for about 1.6s before going back. Clicking the chevron opens a menu below the button, aligned to its right edge, with \"Copy as Markdown\" and \"View as Markdown\", and the chevron points up. Choosing \"Copy as Markdown\" closes the menu and shows the same copied state. Choosing \"View as Markdown\" closes the menu and calls `onViewMarkdown` with the text, or opens `markdownHref` in a new tab. Escape closes the menu.",
