    "summary": "The last section of a landing page. A fanned stack of product cards (the Stacked Card Fan, with its lower edge masked into the page and a \"See all\" pill) sits above a large two-line headline, a short paragraph and a row of actions, all centred on a full-width surface. The first time a quarter of the section scrolls into view, the visual, headline, copy and actions rise, unblur and fade in one after another. The cards stay live: hovering spreads them, clicking cycles them and the pill lays them all out.",
