    "reducedMotion": "`useTweenedValues` is disabled, so the bands render at their final shares on mount and jump on a period change. The headline count runs over 1ms (a single frame), the number fade and the opacity/fill transitions are removed with `motion-reduce:` variants.",
    "cleanup": "The tween and `useCountUp` cancel their pending animation frame on every new target and on unmount. Hover state is plain React state; the Select's outside-press listener is removed by the Select itself when it closes or unmounts.",
