    "reducedMotion": "With `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` the star count shows the final number straight away and no animation frame is requested. Nothing else on the block moves.",
    "cleanup": "The layout effect disconnects the IntersectionObserver and cancels any pending animation frame on unmount or when `stars` changes.",
    "acceptance": "The block shows the heading, paragraph and three checks on the left and the repo card on the right at 1280px, stacked at narrow widths. When the card comes into view the star total counts from 0 to 12,480 in about a second and stops there. Forks read \"642 forks\", license \"MIT license\". The Star button and the secondary link are links with visible focus rings. With reduced motion the total is 12,480 from the start. Light and dark both keep the gradient band and dot grid visible.",
