    "reducedMotion": "With prefers-reduced-motion the tile art does not zoom on hover, the caption appears without rising or fading, the actions appear without a fade, and the lightbox picture swaps without a cross-fade. The kit Modal keeps its opacity fade and drops its scale and blur.",
    "cleanup": "The only listener is the lightbox's window `keydown`, added in an effect while the lightbox is open and removed on close, on every re-render and on unmount. The Modal's overlay, focus trap and scroll lock are handled by React Aria.",
    "acceptance": "Twelve flat illustrations of different heights interlock in columns. Hovering one zooms it slightly, raises its title and style over a dark scrim and shows a heart and a download button. The heart toggles (aria-pressed, rose fill) and the Favourites count updates; the Favourites view shows only hearted pictures. Download on a ready picture updates the status line; on \"Underwater highway\" it does nothing. Clicking a picture opens a 640px lightbox with the title, style, \"n / 12\", previous and next buttons; the arrow keys page it, wrapping at the ends, and Escape closes it.",
