    "reducedMotion": "With prefers-reduced-motion the chips and the card change colour and ring without a transition, and the kit Textarea, Select and NumberField follow their own reduced-motion rules. The footer shimmer is the kit's `agent-progress-loading-text`, which stops moving and keeps its text readable.",
    "cleanup": "The component adds no listeners, timers or observers of its own: the shortcut is a React `onKeyDown` on the field, and the Select's outside-press listener and the Textarea's resize measuring belong to those kit parts. The demo's fake run is one `setTimeout`, cleared when the run ends, is stopped or the demo unmounts.",
    "acceptance": "A grey tray holds a white card with six style chips (Illustration selected), the prompt \"A hoopoe on an olive branch, warm paper texture\", a 4:5 ratio select and a stepper at 2. The footer reads \"2 images · 896 × 1120\". Clearing the prompt makes Generate look disabled and the footer reads \"Write a prompt to generate\"; clicking it does nothing. Generate (or ⌘/Ctrl + Enter) shows the prompt as a bubble with two shimmering frames, locks the form, swaps in Stop and shimmers \"Generating 2 images · 4:5\"; after about 2.4s two pictures fade in and the status reads \"2 ready\". Stop during a run leaves dashed \"Stopped\" frames.",
    "criticalRegion": "critical",
