    "acceptance": "The card renders 330px tall with \"Important alerts\", a large 12 and \"this week\", and a \"29 Jun - 5 Jul\" pill with chevrons on the right. The feed starts with High Heart rate and is cut off mid-row by the card's bottom edge. Scrolling the feed fades a gradient in under the header within 200ms and fades it out again when scrolled back to the top; the page does not scroll when the feed reaches its end. Each row has a coloured circle with a white icon and a date tag in its top-right corner.",
