    "reducedMotion": "The component does not check `prefers-reduced-motion`. The only motion is the 150ms colour and ring transition on the shell, which a global rule that removes transitions turns into an instant change.",
    "cleanup": "Nothing to clean up. The components hold no state, listeners or timers of their own; React Aria owns the field state.",
    "acceptance": "A labelled field shows a grey filled shell with no visible border. Hovering draws a light inset ring; clicking in darkens the ring and the placeholder, with no shift in layout. A required field shows a red asterisk after its label. Typing an invalid email in a field marked invalid tints the shell and its icon red and swaps the hint for the error message. A disabled field is lighter and ignores input. Screen readers announce the label, the hint and, when invalid, the error.",
