    "reducedMotion": "The only motion is the kit Select popover fade and scale, which is a short CSS transition. Nothing in this component animates on its own.",
    "cleanup": "There is nothing of its own to clean up. The kit Select owns its outside-press listener and removes it when the popover closes or the component unmounts.",
    "acceptance": "The trigger reads \"English\" after a translate glyph. Opening it lists 16 languages, each with a flag, a native name and a grey English name, and a check mark on the current one. Typing \"d\" moves focus to Deutsch and Enter selects it. The trigger then reads \"Deutsch\", and `onChange` receives \"de\". In the list, العربية and עברית render right-to-left. Escape or a click outside closes the list without changing the value.",
