    "reducedMotion": "Under reduced motion each reply appears whole once its agent has thought, avatars stop floating and blinking, the thinking label drops its shimmer, and hover transitions use motion-reduce:transition-none. Turn-taking and its timing stay so the order of speakers is still readable.",
    "cleanup": "The single run timeout is cleared on every run change, on pause and on unmount. The share and support copied-state timers clear on unmount.",
    "acceptance": "At 1280 × 800 a conversation list, a conversation and a side panel fill the frame. Typing a message and pressing Enter adds a bubble, then each agent in the conversation thinks and replies in turn. Toggling an agent in the participant row removes it from the next round. The Files tab shows the workspace tree and who last edited each file; the Activity tab pauses, stops and replays the round. Renaming an agent in the editor renames it in the thread. The workspace switcher swaps the conversation list, and the marketplace adds a bot to the team.",
