    "reducedMotion": "The component does not read `prefers-reduced-motion`: the 0.25s entrance, the 0.18s exit and the layout spring run regardless. A host can wrap the app in Motion's `MotionConfig reducedMotion=\"user\"`. The countdown bar also runs, since it shows how much time is left.",
    "cleanup": "The countdown Web Animation is cancelled and the dismiss timeout cleared by their effect cleanups (the timer cleanup also banks the elapsed time). The viewport portal unmounts with its owner.",
    "acceptance": "Nothing shows until a button is pressed. \"Deploy finished\" brings a green success card into the bottom-right stack with a blue bar shrinking over 5 seconds; hovering the stack holds the bar, leaving resumes it, and at the end the card blurs out while the others glide into place. \"New comment\" shows the LS avatar with a green presence dot and Mark read / Reply buttons, either of which closes the card. \"Build failed\" is announced as an alert. The position control moves the stack to the top or bottom centre, and a fifth card pushes the oldest out with its exit animation.",
