    "reducedMotion": "The badge and row highlight change instantly (motion-reduce:transition-none); the kit Popover drops its scale and blur entry and only fades.",
    "cleanup": "Nothing of its own to release: no timers or listeners. The kit PopoverTrigger owns and removes its outside-press listener.",
    "acceptance": "With 5 unread, the bell reads \"Notifications, 5 unread\"; marking one read in the popover makes it \"4 unread\", and \"Mark all as read\" hides the badge and leaves the name \"Notifications\".",
