    "summary": "The patient summary card from BoardUI's medical profile dashboard, built to the Figma frame's measurements. A centred initials avatar carries a small round \"add photo\" button on its corner, the name sits under it, and four inset rows list date of birth, gender, blood type and GP, each with a leading icon. The content is fixed sample copy. The card is a layout to copy and wire to your own record.",
