    "summary": "A compact usage tile for a subscription: the plan name in the header, one row per limit (a 5-hour window, weekly caps) with its label, when it resets and the share used, a 4px meter under each row, and a footer with the renewal date and an Upgrade button. Meters change colour as they fill so the limit that will stop you first stands out. `bare` drops the surface so the same rows can sit under a context-window card in one \"Agent limits\" tile.",
