    "reducedMotion": "Every transition (veil filter/opacity/scale, chip fade, pill colour) carries `motion-reduce:transition-none`, so the preview snaps between veiled and clear.",
    "cleanup": "The component holds no timers or listeners. The demo's simulated activation is a `setTimeout` inside an effect keyed on the status and cleared in its cleanup.",
    "acceptance": "The demo loads with a blurred revenue chart, an \"Unlock to use this component\" chip, a \"Pro access\" pill and a \"Get Pro\" button; nothing in the preview is focusable. Clicking Get Pro shows \"Activating…\" with a spinner and aria-disabled for about 900ms, then the chart sharpens, the chip fades, the pill reads \"Unlocked\", the footer says the licence is active and focus lands on \"Lock again\". Clicking Lock again restores the veil and the Get Pro button.",
