    "reducedMotion": "Nothing animates on its own. The only motion is the kit tab underline sliding and the buttons changing colour, both short CSS transitions; the artwork is static. In dark mode the cover is dimmed to 85% brightness so it does not glare.",
    "cleanup": "The component owns no timers, listeners or observers. The tab strip uses the kit TabList, which disconnects its own resize and mutation observers on unmount.",
    "acceptance": "A card shows a blue sky cover, an 80px \"M\" avatar overlapping its bottom edge, \"Mira Okafor\", \"@miraok\" with a PRO pill, \"1,284 followers\" and four tabs. Clicking Follow turns it into a pressed secondary \"Following\" button and the count reads 1,285; clicking again reverts. Switching the view to Owner swaps Follow for Edit. Arrow keys move between tabs and the panel below changes; at 360px wide the tab strip scrolls instead of wrapping.",
