    "cleanup": "`RadarActiveAxis` only runs an effect that calls the setter, `useCountUp` cancels its animation frame on target change and unmount, `useReducedMotion` unsubscribes its media-query listener, `ResponsiveContainer` disconnects its resize observer, and the kit `Select` tears down its popover when closed. The card adds no listeners or timers of its own.",
    "acceptance": "The card shows \"Visitors\", \"1,424\" with a lime \"+5.2%\" chip and an \"H1 2024\" pill, a lime and a blue radar outline on a grey hexagon grid labelled January to June, a legend reading \"Desktop 1,424\" and \"Mobile 860\", and six tiles January 186 to June 214. Hovering an axis pulses both vertices, opens a tooltip with both values and switches the header and legend to that month. Clicking \"Desktop\" hides the lime outline, and the header reads \"860\" with \"+7.5%\"; clicking \"Mobile\" then does nothing. Picking \"H2 2024\" shows \"1,598\" and \"+12.2%\".",
