    "reducedMotion": "Under `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` the scatter entrance animation is off (`isAnimationActive={false}`), the headline shows its value with no count-up, and `.animate-number-fade` is removed with `motion-reduce:animate-none`. The series dimming and the chevron rotation change instantly through `motion-reduce:transition-none`.",
    "cleanup": "`useResizeObserver` unregisters the plot wrapper from the shared observer on unmount. `useCountUp` cancels its animation frame when the target changes and on unmount. `ResponsiveContainer` disconnects its own observer. The dropdown's outside-press listener is removed when the menu closes. Pointer and key handlers are React props.",
    "acceptance": "The card shows \"Revenue per account\", \"744\" and a lime \"+6.8%\" chip, with a \"This quarter\" pill. The plot has lime, blue and purple bubbles on a dashed grid with ticks 0–100 and 0–1.7K, \"Revenue\" and \"Sessions\" captions, and tiles reading Starter · avg 270, Growth · avg 783 and Scale · avg 1,388. Hovering the top-right bubble changes the header to \"Quill · Scale\" and \"1,640\", dims the lime and blue dots and shows a readout with Sessions 98. Focusing the plot and pressing End does the same. Picking \"This year\" from the pill redraws the plot with larger values and a \"+18.2%\" chip.",
