    "reducedMotion": "The fades are CSS transitions and the component does not check `prefers-reduced-motion` itself. Spinner's glyph does: under `motion-reduce` its spin slows from 900ms to 2400ms per turn.",
    "cleanup": "Nothing to clean up. The component keeps one piece of state and a ref; the spinner's CSS animation is paused while hidden.",
    "acceptance": "An empty pill field shows a search icon and no clear button. Typing a letter scales the clear button in at the end; clicking it empties the field and keeps the caret in it. Escape also clears it. While `isLoading` is true the search icon shrinks away and a spinning light takes its place, then swaps back when loading ends. With `shape=\"rounded\"` the corners match Input. Tab never lands on the clear button.",
    "criticalRegion": "critical",
