    "cleanup": "There are no effects, timers or listeners. The swatch keyboard handler is a React prop on the radio group. The Language Select and ThemeToggle own and clean up their own listeners.",
    "acceptance": "At 1280px the footer shows the logo and tagline on the left and X, Discord, a \"2.4k\" GitHub button and Get Pro on the right. Six columns follow, Components and Charts ending in \"View all (96) →\" and \"View all (18) →\", and Affiliate carries an \"Earn 40%\" pill. The bottom bar reads, left to right: the English select and the sun/moon toggle, seven centred colour dots, then \"© 2026 Tessera Labs · Privacy · Terms · License\". Clicking a link calls `onLinkClick` with its href. Tabbing reaches the swatches once, and ArrowRight checks the next dot. At 360px the columns become two and the bottom bar stacks.",
