    "cleanup": "Nothing of its own: no listeners, timers or effects. The Dropdown and Drawer clean up their overlays and outside-press listeners when they close or unmount.",
    "acceptance": "At 1280px the bar shows the logo, Components with a chevron, Templates, Docs, Blog, a Quick Search pill with ⌘K, two social icons, a GitHub pill reading 963, Get Pro and the theme toggle. Clicking Components opens a panel of three rows; choosing Charts closes it and marks Components current. Escape closes the panel. Clicking the search pill opens the command palette. In a 390px container only the logo, a search icon and a menu button show; the menu button opens an end drawer listing every link, and choosing one closes the drawer.",
