    "reducedMotion": "The sweep is removed (`::after { display: none }`) and each block instead breathes with `bui-skeleton-pulse`, a 2s ease-in-out opacity dip to 0.55. The reveal drops its transition and skips the blur (`motion-reduce:transition-none`, `motion-safe:blur-[4px]`), so loaded content simply appears.",
