    "reducedMotion": "A `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` rule in the hoisted stylesheet removes the beam animation and parks the track at `translateX(150%)`, its centred position. The beam stays as a still highlight on the border.",
    "cleanup": "Nothing to clean up. The beam is a CSS animation, and there are no effects, timers or listeners. The hoisted `<style>` is deduplicated by its `href`, so many cards share one stylesheet.",
    "acceptance": "At full width the avatars, the copy and the action sit in one row, and a short blue beam drifts along the top border and back. In a 360px container the action drops under the copy. Five people with `maxAvatars` 3 show three initials and \"+2\". Clicking the action calls `onAction`. With `href` it is a link opening in a new tab. With reduced motion the beam sits still in the middle of the border.",
    "criticalRegion": "critical",
