    "acceptance": "The row reads \"Next.js v16 · React v19.2 · Tailwind CSS v4 · TypeScript v5.9 · Motion v12 · React Aria v1.17\", each with a monogram tile. Hovering \"React\" lifts that badge 2px and opens a tooltip reading \"React 19.2 / UI runtime\". Tabbing onto a badge does the same. In the icon card, hovering the \"TT\" tile shows \"TanStack Table 8.21\".",
