    "reducedMotion": "The pill jumps to the selected tab and panels switch without the fade or scale (both transitions are omitted); the tab strip scrolls with `behavior: \"auto\"`.",
    "cleanup": "The layout effect disconnects its ResizeObserver and removes the strip scroll listener on every re-run and on unmount.",
    "acceptance": "At 1280px the card shows seven tabs with Agentic chat on the blue pill and a chat app preview below. Clicking Project board slides the pill there and crossfades to a four-column kanban; arrow keys move between tabs the same way. The Live preview button label follows the tab. At 390px the strip scrolls sideways with an edge fade, selecting a clipped tab scrolls it into view, and the previews drop their sidebars.",
