    "cleanup": "The `useSyncExternalStore` subscription disconnects its `MutationObserver` and removes its `kinetic:theme-change` and `storage` listeners on unmount. Each transition removes its injected `<style>` and the `.theme-transitioning` class in a `finally`, so an aborted transition leaves nothing behind.",
    "acceptance": "Clicking the moon in the segmented pill slides the thumb and reveals the dark theme in a soft-edged circle that grows from the cursor until it covers the screen, with no flash or crossfade. Clicking the sun reverses it from the new click point. Activating with the keyboard starts the circle from the control's centre. All toggles in the demo, and the site header toggle, change together. With reduced motion turned on the theme switches instantly. Rapid double clicks do not stack two reveals.",
    "criticalRegion": "critical",
