    "reducedMotion": "The only motion is the 150ms rotation of the sort chevron and the row hover colour; the chevron carries `motion-reduce:transition-none`, so it flips instantly under `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`.",
    "cleanup": "The component adds no timers or listeners of its own. The kit Pagination disconnects its ResizeObserver on unmount, and the Select popover is closed by React Aria.",
