    "reducedMotion": "Rows appear without the blur, lift or height animation, the guide is drawn at once, the shimmer and star twinkle stop, marks no longer lift on hover, and the Sources list opens and closes instantly. Rows still arrive on the same schedule.",
    "cleanup": "The ticker clears its pending timeout whenever the revealed count, run flag or pacing changes and on unmount; the Working row clears its timer on unmount; tooltips are owned by react-aria and close with their trigger.",
