    "reducedMotion": "Nothing moves. The grid opens already scrolled to `scrollToHour` with an instant `scrollTop`, never a smooth scroll; the only transition is the kit chip's 150ms hover brightness and selection ring, which changes no position or size.",
    "cleanup": "One mount effect assigns `scrollTop` and returns nothing; there are no listeners, timers or observers. Formatters are cached in a module-level map.",
    "acceptance": "The week of August 16 2026 opens scrolled to 08:00 with Sun 16 to Sat 22 in the header and 20 in an accent pill. Planning and Design crit on Monday sit side by side at half width; Retro, Demo day and Wrap-up on Friday split three ways where they overlap. Payday spans Wednesday and Holidays spans Friday and Saturday in the all-day row. A red line and a \"10:42\" pill mark Thursday. Clicking Stand-up opens its details popover; Delete removes the block, lowers the count and offers Undo. At 360px the body scrolls sideways with the hour gutter pinned.",
