    "reducedMotion": "The popover keeps its opacity fade from the kit surface but drops nothing else that moves; the trigger entrance, hover fills and check fade all use motion-reduce:transition-none, so a switch swaps contents instantly.",
    "cleanup": "The outside-press and trigger-toggle hooks add document pointerdown listeners only while open and remove them on close or unmount; there are no timers.",
    "acceptance": "Clicking the trigger opens a menu of workspaces with exactly one checked; choosing another closes the menu and the trigger shows the new name and plan; Escape closes with focus on the trigger; arrow keys move between rows; \"Create workspace\" runs the callback and is never checked.",
